Hi,
  I think that the reason you get an error when the MASS library is
attempted to be loaded is that the library function call is trying to refer
to the library argument in the function definition. Try using a different
argument name. You might also test to see if the function that you need is
available before loading the MASS library, although I don't think that
there is a problem in multiple library calls.
