I received several suggestions, all of which worked nicely:

if(any(1,2,3,na.rm=T))

is.true <- function(x) return(x & !is.na(x))
if(any(is.true(c(1,2,3))))

pmax(1,2,3,na.rm=T)

Thanks to Sam Buttrey, Tony Plate, Bill Dunlap, and Scott Saleska.

mlk

